
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#073d2b">
<meta name="description" content="Register an educational institution on EDUNEXA.">
<title>Register Your School | EDUNEXA</title>
<style>
:root {
  --green: #073d2b;
  --green2: #0c6245;
  --gold: #d6ad50;
  --bg: #f4f7f4;
  --ink: #18251f;
  --muted: #66756d;
  --line: #dce5de;
  --white: #fff;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.55;
}
header {
  background: var(--green);
  color: white;
  padding: 18px 5%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16px;
}
.brand {
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  font-size: 22px;
}
.brand span { color: var(--gold); }
header a {
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 14px;
}
main {
  max-width: 980px;
  margin: 34px auto;
  padding: 0 16px 50px;
}
.intro {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.eyebrow {
  color: var(--green2);
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  font-size: 12px;
}
.intro h1 {
  color: var(--green);
  font-size: clamp(27px, 5vw, 38px);
  margin: 7px 0;
}
.intro p {
  color: var(--muted);
  max-width: 650px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.notice {
  background: #fff8e8;
  border: 1px solid #ecd9a8;
  border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
  padding: 13px 15px;
  border-radius: 9px;
  margin: 22px 0;
  color: #59451c;
  font-size: 13px;
}
form, .result {
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 15px;
  padding: clamp(18px, 4vw, 30px);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(7,61,43,.06);
}
.section-title {
  color: var(--green);
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 800;
  margin: 8px 0 16px;
  padding-bottom: 9px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 16px;
}
.field {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 6px;
}
.field.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
label {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #34463c;
}
input, select, textarea {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 12px 13px;
  border: 1px solid #cbd8cf;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: #fff;
  font: inherit;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--ink);
  outline: none;
}
input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
  border-color: var(--green2);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(12,98,69,.1);
}
textarea {
  min-height: 85px;
  resize: vertical;
}
.hint {
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--muted);
}
.check {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 10px;
  margin: 20px 0;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #435349;
}
.check input {
  width: auto;
  margin-top: 4px;
}
button {
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 9px;
  background: var(--green2);
  color: white;
  padding: 14px 20px;
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 14px;
  cursor: pointer;
  width: 100%;
}
button:hover { background: var(--green); }
.back {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 18px;
  color: var(--green2);
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 13px;
}
.result {
  display: none;
  margin-top: 18px;
  border-color: #c9dfcf;
}
.result h2 {
  color: var(--green);
  margin-top: 0;
}
.code {
  font-size: 25px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  color: var(--green);
  background: #eef5ef;
  padding: 13px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  text-align: center;
}
.result p {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--muted);
}
footer {
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 12px;
  padding: 20px;
}
@media(max-width:650px) {
  .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .field.full { grid-column: auto; }
  header { padding: 15px 4%; }
  .brand { font-size: 19px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="brand">EDU<span>NEXA</span></div>
  <a href="index.html">← Back to homepage</a>
</header>

<main>

<div class="intro">
  <div class="eyebrow">EDUNEXA School Network</div>
  <h1>Register Your School</h1>
  <p>Start your school's registration profile. Complete the sections below using sample information while the secure online registration system is being connected.</p>
</div>

<div class="notice">
  <strong>Development preview:</strong>
  This page is not connected to the secure EDUNEXA database yet.
  Do not enter real school, staff, student, phone, email, or password information.
  Use fictional test details only.
  The code shown after submission is a temporary preview code, not an official school ID.
</div>

<form id="schoolForm">

<div class="section-title">1. School Information</div>

<div class="grid">

<div class="field">
<label for="schoolName">School / Institution Name *</label>
<input id="schoolName" required maxlength="100" placeholder="e.g. Demo International School">
</div>

<div class="field">
<label for="type">Institution Type *</label>
<select id="type" required>
<option value="">Select institution type</option>
<option>Nursery / Early Childhood</option>
<option>Primary School</option>
<option>Secondary School</option>
<option>Nursery, Primary & Secondary</option>
<option>College of Education</option>
<option>Polytechnic</option>
<option>University</option>
<option>Vocational / Technical Institution</option>
<option>Montessori School</option>
<option>Special Education School</option>
<option>International School</option>
<option>Faith-Based School</option>
<option>Tutorial / Training Centre</option>
<option>Other</option>
</select>
</div>

<div class="field">
<label for="country">Country *</label>
<select id="country" required>
<option value="">Select country</option>
<option selected>Nigeria</option>
<option>Ghana</option>
<option>Kenya</option>
<option>South Africa</option>
<option>Other</option>
</select>
</div>

<div class="field">
<label for="state">State / Region *</label>
<input id="state" required placeholder="e.g. Ogun State">
</div>

<div class="field">
<label for="city">City / Town *</label>
<input id="city" required placeholder="e.g. Ota">
</div>

<div class="field">
<label for="website">School Website (optional)</label>
<input id="website" type="url" placeholder="https://example.com">
</div>

<div class="field full">
<label for="address">School Address *</label>
<textarea id="address" required placeholder="Enter a fictional school address for this test"></textarea>
</div>

</div>

<div class="section-title" style="margin-top:28px">
2. School Contact (Test Details Only)
</div>

<div class="grid">

<div class="field">
<label for="email">Official School Email *</label>
<input id="email" type="email" required placeholder="demo@example.com">
</div>

<div class="field">
<label for="phone">School Contact Phone *</label>
<input id="phone" type="tel" required placeholder="+234 000 000 0000">
</div>

<div class="field">
<label for="size">Approximate Number of Learners</label>
<select id="size">
<option value="">Select range</option>
<option>Below 100</option>
<option>100–500</option>
<option>501–1,000</option>
<option>1,001–5,000</option>
<option>Above 5,000</option>
</select>
</div>

<div class="field">
<label for="year">Year Established (optional)</label>
<input id="year" type="number" min="1800" max="2100" placeholder="e.g. 2015">
</div>

</div>

<div class="section-title" style="margin-top:28px">
3. Main Contact Person (Fictional Test Details)
</div>

<div class="grid">

<div class="field">
<label for="contactName">Contact Person's Name *</label>
<input id="contactName" required placeholder="e.g. Alex Demo">
</div>

<div class="field">
<label for="role">Position / Role *</label>
<select id="role" required>
<option value="">Select role</option>
<option>Proprietor / Owner</option>
<option>School Director</option>
<option>Principal</option>
<option>Head Teacher</option>
<option>Administrator</option>
<option>Other</option>
</select>
</div>

</div>

<label class="check">
<input type="checkbox" id="confirm" required>
<span>I understand this is a demonstration form and I am using fictional test information only.</span>
</label>

<button type="submit">PREVIEW REGISTRATION</button>

</form>

<div class="result" id="result" aria-live="polite">
<h2>Registration preview created</h2>
<p>Your test information passed the form checks. This is not a live submission and nothing has been sent to EDUNEXA.</p>
<div class="code" id="previewCode">EDU-PREVIEW</div>
<p><strong>Status:</strong> Preview only — not submitted for approval.</p>
<p>When the secure backend is ready, this form can be connected to official school registration and school-code issuance.</p>
</div>

<a class="back" href="index.html">← Return to EDUNEXA homepage</a>

</main>

<footer>
© 2026 EDUNEXA. One Platform. Every School. Endless Possibilities.
</footer>

<script>
document.getElementById('schoolForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
  e.preventDefault();

  if (!this.reportValidity()) return;

  const code = 'EDU-PREVIEW-' +
    Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 7).toUpperCase();

  document.getElementById('previewCode').textContent = code;
  document.getElementById('result').style.display = 'block';

  document.getElementById('result').scrollIntoView({
    behavior: 'smooth',
    block: 'center'
  });
});
</script>

</body>
</html>
